{
  "DESCRIPTION": "Polar oscilloscope: the synced waveform wrapped around a circle as a phosphor ring (L outer, R inner), with loops, mirror or seam-closing wrap and a spinning start mark. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants. HUD instrument look: thin lines in a bracketed panel, dashed grid, tick rulers with numerals, readouts, field-colour variants",
